Z||000006||fierocrazy||09-04-2000||05:21 PM||||yeah I know you need a front wheel drive motor, why dont you go to a 3.1 if you are going to get a new motor, , just the short block will due, and have your heads rebuilt.  alittle pocket porting, Dont touch the vein.  ANd I think you will ne more than happy, remember to get the flywheel and crank pulley and balancer  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>85GT 3.2||||reg||1
